{"overview":"شیوام که روزگاری یک گانگستر ترسناک بود، اکنون در سایه‌ای از گذشته‌اش زندگی می‌کند و دیگر به خدا یا خود ایمان ندارد. اما سرنوشت او را به جنگ کارتل‌های بانکوک می‌کشاند و او را به تاریکی‌ای که سوگند خورده بود هرگز بازنگردد، بازمی‌گرداند؛ شیوام باید تصمیم بگیرد برای چه چیزی می‌خواهد زندگی کند، وقتی که دیگر چیزی برای از دست دادن ندارد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Once a feared gangster, Shivam lives hidden away from his past, with no faith left in God or himself. But when fate pulls him into Bangkok's cartel war and forces him back into the darkness he swore never to return to, Shivam must choose what he is willing to live for, when there is nothing left to lose.","tagline_en":"From The Shadows To Settle An Old Debt With Death.","runtime":142,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Nitin Kakkar"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["IN"],"cast":[{"name":"عمران هاشمی","role":"Shivam Pandit","photo":"/kflgvFCFZnpTRbKmJWn5T0G5EKI.jpg","en":"Emraan Hashmi"},{"name":"شبانه عظمی","role":"Nafisa Nawaz","photo":"/gy7DpFaZnpU4XOwBc8jhhE8rYYj.jpg","en":"Shabana Azmi"},{"name":"दिशा पाटनी","role":"Zara","photo":"/jeFgIW3d3BP6MkfnMlmEGP33Oyq.jpg","en":"Disha Patani"},{"name":"Puran Gabbi","role":"Zorawar","photo":""},{"name":"Suvinder Vicky","role":"Jaideep","photo":"/6T3Y0jvLMdMw19ShLZvLNHIkaSD.jpg"},{"name":"Vijayant Kohli","role":"Mehmood","photo":"/dzzewlf0Z5dEkVxu4QkH86xUEx4.jpg"},{"name":"Atul Kumar","role":"Samarth","photo":"/rbPFvPZgqiK21z4uyD5QhRwr7bb.jpg"},{"name":"Aniruddh Rawal","role":"Sikander","photo":""},{"name":"Myrah Shivan","role":"Aliyah (Kid)","photo":""},{"name":"Jukreed Kamdee","role":"Genghis","photo":""},{"name":"Barun Chanda","role":"Amrit","photo":"/2THPtKqqFxgOsrNHmPxBOhXzthY.jpg"},{"name":"Rukhsar Rehman","role":"Namrata","photo":"/4iRIgfCtBB2WZ5mhumrTiOA3dGK.jpg"}],"trailer":"1ya87ENCRj0","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1444466/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpa